PNG-SPEC v1.2 HIGH-FIDELITY
Canvas: 2400x1600 px
Background: Transparent
Stroke: 4px Black
Font: Inter-SemiBold 32px White

Layers:
  L0: Coordinate Frame
  L1: Manifold Patch
  L2: Curve γ(t)
    - Same curve as F2 for continuity
  L3: Vector Transport
    - Vector v at γ(0)
    - Same vector transported along γ(t) at t1, t2
    - Use consistent orientation and magnitude
    - Transported vectors in orange (#FF8C00FF)
  L4: Labels
    - "v" at start
    - "Parallel Transport" near transported vectors
  L5: Annotation Overlay
    - Equation: "∇_{γ̇} V = 0"

Export:
  PNG (RGBA)
